  "design_implications": [
    "Assess single-trial attenuation, extinction, occasional growth and later reactivation alongside the mean semantic response.",
    "Regulated total activity does not itself establish survival of the earlier semantic/contextual influence.",
    "Changing frame duration, stochastic rounding, update law and saturation together can obscure the cause of behavior; compare their contributions explicitly.",
    "Low integer width is neither the stochastic model nor proof of faithful natural cessation. Wider deterministic state with explicitly chosen noise remains a comparison."
